"{\n    \"entries\": [\n        {\n            \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n            \"text\": \"Katamā anumatipucchā? Bhagavā bhikkhūnaṃ anumatiyā pañhaṃ pucchati – ‘taṃ kiṃ maññatha, bhikkhave,\\n        rūpaṃ niccaṃ vā aniccaṃ vā’ti? ‘Aniccaṃ, bhante’. ‘Yaṃ panāniccaṃ dukkhaṃ vā taṃ sukhaṃ vā’ti? ‘Dukkhaṃ, bhante’\\n        {footnote1}. ‘Yaṃ panāniccaṃ dukkhaṃ vipariṇāmadhammaṃ,\\n        kallaṃ nu taṃ samanupassituṃ etaṃ mama, esohamasmi, eso me attā’ti? ‘Nohetaṃ, bhante’ti (saṃ. ni. 3.79; mahāva.\\n        21). Ayaṃ anumatipucchā.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"footnotes\": [\n        {\n            \"type\": \"footnote\",\n            \"text\": \"1. PTS-Vol 0-Page 56\"\n        }\n    ]\n}"